  "title": "Speed Upgrade",
  "recipes": true,
  "text": [
    "Right-click the upgrade to insert or remove spell cores. Add the left and right slot multipliers to get the total. Two empty slots give 2×.",
    "This multiplier also applies to the Cruise Orb’s base flight speed.",
    "Install at most one per device to multiply logistics limits and speed up bucket exchange. Each transfer method retains its own allowance.",
    "The upgrade adds no automatic transfer and does not speed processing or lava generation. Cruise Orbs still reject Intake and Output Upgrades."
